    {
      "role": "user",
      "content": "that's interesting, but don't you think that prioritizing \"healing\" and \"reintegration\" kind of undermines the idea of actual justice for the victim? if someone commits a violent crime, doesn't a \"morally sound\" system have to focus on the retribution and the proportional punishment to satisfy the moral debt owed to society?",
